      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm writing a paper for my art history class about deconstruction in modern art. i've noticed a lot of lately that it feels like political messaging is being prioritized over actual aesthetic beauty in contemporary art. how has that trend impacted the overall value of art today?",
