    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. So you're saying the \"shallow\" nature comes from the intent behind the work. But what about critics who argue that traditional \"aesthetic beauty\" is just a subjective, Eurocentric standard used to gatekeep what counts as \"good\" art? How would you respond to the idea that what you're calling \"proselytizing\" is actually just a necessary way to deconstruct those old power structures?",
